@title Crowded cabinet: device tags on the plate and 3D labels (look at the pictures for text on text)
@area Cabinet
@slow
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
open qa/fixtures/text-stress-cabinet.novo
wait 30
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 40
shot cabinet-fit
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text zoom to fit
wait 8
key Enter
wait 20
shot cabinet-zoom
click_text 3D #1
wait 60
shot 3d
